## Case: basic-ref
id: "av.parity.1081.basic-ref"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1081", "functions"]
links: ["PLAN-1081", "PLAN-383"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
// Plan 383: 命名函数引用作为值 — 最小用例。
// `let f = twice` 把命名函数作为值（函数引用），`f(5)` 通过引用调用。
fn twice(x int) int { return x * 2 }
fn main() {
    let f = twice
    print(f(5))
    print(f(10))
}
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
caps: ["ac.source.language.av/v1", "console.stdout", "console.stderr"]
channel: "unit"

#### stdout

```text
10
20
```

### VM result
#ignore
check-id: "vm-stdout"

```text
10
20
```

### Notes

legacy.27_function_reference.001_basic_ref (source SHA16 f3f6b0b4ae6be783):
one `let f = twice` binding, TWO indirect calls through it. The legacy
fn name `double` is a reserved numeric type word — normalized `twice`.

