## Case: call-unchanged
id: "av.parity.1081.call-unchanged"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1081", "functions"]
links: ["PLAN-1081", "PLAN-383"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
// Plan 383 回归守护：命名函数的直接调用行为完全不变。
// twice(5) 是调用，不是函数引用（值位置）。
fn twice(x int) int { return x * 2 }
fn main() {
    print(twice(5))
    print(twice(7))
}
```

