hi from inner
after
```

### VM result
#ignore
check-id: "vm-stdout"

```text
hi from inner
after
```

### Notes

legacy.99_idiom2.d01_nested_fn_void (24d7495ae2723410): the nested fn
ITEM is hoisted under an owner-mangled name and RUNS when called — the
legacy silent-drop bug (inner() 静默无输出) is closed on the ordinary AV
chain.

## Case: nested-fn-capture
id: "av.parity.1081.nested-fn-capture"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1081", "functions"]
links: ["PLAN-1081", "PLAN-514"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
// Plan 514 W1-2 探针 d01b：嵌套 fn 引用外层局部变量
// 正确语义：明确报错（具名 fn 非闭包，按 Rust 嵌套 fn 语义外层名不可捕获）。
fn main() {
    let base = 10
    fn grab(n int) int { return base + n }
    print(grab(5))
}
```

