### Notes

legacy.99_idiom2.d01b_nested_fn_capture (4f0a9f0abc20f45f; legacy
vm-error/error-presence oracle): the named rejection a nested fn item
cannot capture outer locals — the exact AV face of the legacy
error-presence lane, never a silent 0.
